# A suction grasp on a tracked item (OptiGrasp on the latest colour image, the item's mask cropped to its bin): the
# grasp point in frame_id (depth at the grasp pixel, through the camera's lens model) and the model's tilt.
string item_id
string frame_id
---
bool success
string message
string bin_id
geometry_msgs/PointStamped point
# The model's angles, rad (roll from its roll map +-20 deg, pitch from its pitch map +-10 deg). The ROS 1 demo turned
# them into a tool orientation as euler xyz (roll, -pitch, 0) in the camera frame; the skill decides how to use them.
float64 roll
float64 pitch
# Grasp pixel (x, y) in the colour image
int32 pixel_x
int32 pixel_y
